{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41376","headline":"赠胥尊师 · 熊皎","name":"赠胥尊师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿发童颜羽服轻，天台王屋几经行。\n云程去速因风起，酒债还迟待药成。\n房闭十洲烟浪阔，籙开三洞鬼神惊。\n他年华表重归日，却恐桑田已变更。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"熊皎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}